{"type": "user", "message": {"role": "user", "content": [{"tool_use_id": "toolu_012FCWGt1CNoXm98uzWzuLcc", "type": "tool_result", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "{\"excerpt_removed\": true, \"references\": [{\"url\": \"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/International_Baptist_Theological_Study_Centre\"}, {\"url\": \"https://blog.ibts.eu/?p=58\"}, {\"url\": \"https://seminary.academia.edu/LeeSpitzer\"}, {\"url\": \"https://biblicalstudies.org.uk/blog/wp-json/wp/v2/posts/10753\"}, {\"url\": \"https://www.ibts.eu/assets/files/director-appointment-advert.pdf\"}, {\"url\": \"https://vu.nl/nl/over-de-vu/faculteiten/school-voor-religie-en-theologie/meer-over/international-baptist-theological-study-centre\"}, {\"url\": \"https://vu.nl/nl/over-de-vu/faculteiten/faculteit-religie-en-theologie/meer-over/international-baptist-theological-study-centre\"}, {\"url\": \"https://www.ibts.eu/assets/files/director-appointment-advert-1708440218.pdf\"}, {\"url\": \"https://jebs.eu/ojs/index.php/jebs/about\"}, {\"url\": \"https://baptistnews.com/?p=125261\"}]}"}]}]}, "parent_tool_use_id": null, "timestamp": "2026-10-20T12:29:11.254Z", "tool_use_result": {"query": "Rev. Dr. Lee B. Spitzer PhD Vrije Universiteit Amsterdam International Baptist Theological Study Centre", "results": [{"tool_use_id": "srvtoolu_01Bq6h6eTVA7QnF6keUrh6EP", "content": [{"title": "International Baptist Theological Study Centre", "url": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/International_Baptist_Theological_Study_Centre"}, {"title": "blog.ibts.eu", "url": "https://blog.ibts.eu/?p=58"}, {"title": "seminary.academia.edu", "url": "https://seminary.academia.edu/LeeSpitzer"}, {"title": "biblicalstudies.org.uk", "url": "https://biblicalstudies.org.uk/blog/wp-json/wp/v2/posts/10753"}, {"title": "director appointment advert", "url": "https://www.ibts.eu/assets/files/director-appointment-advert.pdf"}, {"title": "Onderwijs Onderzoek Actueel Over de VU EN", "url": "https://vu.nl/nl/over-de-vu/faculteiten/school-voor-religie-en-theologie/meer-over/international-baptist-theological-study-centre"}, {"title": "Onderwijs Onderzoek Actueel Over de VU EN", "url": "https://vu.nl/nl/over-de-vu/faculteiten/faculteit-religie-en-theologie/meer-over/international-baptist-theological-study-centre"}, {"title": "director appointment advert 1708440218", "url": "https://www.ibts.eu/assets/files/director-appointment-advert-1708440218.pdf"}, {"title": "jebs.eu", "url": "https://jebs.eu/ojs/index.php/jebs/about"}, {"title": "Baptist News Global", "url": "https://baptistnews.com/?p=125261"}]}, "The search found one profile that links Lee Spitzer to IBTS, but nothing that ties him to a Vrije Universiteit appointment or confirms his doctorate.\n\n- **Spitzer's listed roles:** An Academia.edu profile describes him as a historian with the Baptist World Alliance, an affiliate professor of church history at Northern Seminary, and a research fellow at IBTS, Amsterdam. It also notes he is a retired ABCUSA General Secretary. The profile lists an address in Riverton, New Jersey.\n- **The institution:** IBTS is a Baptist theological school, located in Amsterdam, Netherlands. It offers a PhD programme for study and research in a collaborative partnership with the Faculty of Religion and Theology at the VU (Vrije Universiteit).\n- **The VU link:** IBTS's own materials describe the VU arrangement as a formal arrangement of 'collaborative partner'. The VU site says IBTS and the VU together offer PhD programmes.\n\nGaps: I found no source confirming a \"Rev. Dr.\" title or a PhD for Lee Spitzer, and no source placing him at the VU. The Academia.edu page is a self-maintained profile, so it is worth checking the IBTS \"our people\" page or a current directory before relying on it."], "durationSeconds": 6.906308416999999, "searchCount": 1}, "tool_result_meta": [{"id": "toolu_012FCWGt1CNoXm98uzWzuLcc", "permission_decision": {"decision": "accept", "source": "hook", "reason_type": "hook"}}]}
