{"type": "user", "message": {"role": "user", "content": [{"tool_use_id": "toolu_01FrPfHnLznKFFmdrGULqjw4", "type": "tool_result", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "{\"excerpt_removed\": true, \"references\": [{\"url\": \"https://contemporarychurchhistory.org/?p=2516\"}, {\"url\": \"https://contemporarychurchhistory.org/tag/baptists/\"}, {\"url\": \"https://ibts.eu/about/our-people/dr-lee-spitzer\"}, {\"url\": \"https://www.judsonpress.com/Products/J253/baptists-jews-and-the-holocaust.aspx\"}, {\"url\": \"https://www.judsonpress.com/Products/507E/baptists-jews-and-the-holocaust-eb.aspx\"}, {\"url\": \"https://www.judsonpress.com/Products/J303/sympathy-solidarity-and-silence.aspx\"}, {\"url\": \"https://abc-usa.org/?p=28837\"}, {\"url\": \"https://seminary.academia.edu/LeeSpitzer\"}, {\"url\": \"https://wordandway.org/?p=77675\"}, {\"url\": \"https://podcast.wordandway.org/2022/11\"}]}"}]}]}, "parent_tool_use_id": null, "timestamp": "2026-10-20T12:29:18.576Z", "tool_use_result": {"query": "Lee B. Spitzer PhD in church history Baptist World Alliance historian awarded PhD Vrije Universiteit Amsterdam", "results": [{"tool_use_id": "srvtoolu_019NPYGU9QBmEMicm9aYbGn4", "content": [{"title": "Review of Lee B. Spitzer, Baptists, Jews, and the Holocaust: The Hand of Sincere Friendship", "url": "https://contemporarychurchhistory.org/?p=2516"}, {"title": "Tag Archives: Baptists", "url": "https://contemporarychurchhistory.org/tag/baptists/"}, {"title": "dr lee spitzer", "url": "https://ibts.eu/about/our-people/dr-lee-spitzer"}, {"title": "baptists jews and the holocaust", "url": "https://www.judsonpress.com/Products/J253/baptists-jews-and-the-holocaust.aspx"}, {"title": "baptists jews and the holocaust eb", "url": "https://www.judsonpress.com/Products/507E/baptists-jews-and-the-holocaust-eb.aspx"}, {"title": "sympathy solidarity and silence", "url": "https://www.judsonpress.com/Products/J303/sympathy-solidarity-and-silence.aspx"}, {"title": "abc usa", "url": "https://abc-usa.org/?p=28837"}, {"title": "seminary.academia.edu", "url": "https://seminary.academia.edu/LeeSpitzer"}, {"title": "wordandway.org", "url": "https://wordandway.org/?p=77675"}, {"title": "Preview Mode Links will not work in preview mode", "url": "https://podcast.wordandway.org/2022/11"}]}, "Lee B. Spitzer does hold a PhD from Vrije Universiteit Amsterdam, earned in association with the International Baptist Theological Study Centre (IBTS). His current roles are as historian for the Baptist World Alliance and affiliate professor of church history at Northern Seminary in Chicago.\n\n- **The PhD:** A Judson Press author bio says his doctorate came from the university together with IBTS. The IBTS listing gives the PhD as \"IBTS, VU Amsterdam\", and his dissertation examined how Baptists in the United States and the Baptist World Alliance acted, which led to the publication of Baptists, Jews, and the Holocaust.\n- **Current roles:** IBTS lists him as affiliate professor of church history at Northern Seminary and historian at the Baptist World Alliance. He is also a Research Fellow for IBTS, and he serves on the Committee on Ethics, Religion, and the Holocaust for the United States Holocaust Memorial Museum.\n- **Background:** He is the retired General Secretary of the American Baptist Churches USA, the first person of Jewish descent to hold that office.\n- **Research focus:** His major field is how Baptists responded to the rise of Hitler, Nazism, and the Holocaust. His books include Baptists, Jews, and the Holocaust: The Hand of Sincere Friendship (Judson Press, 2017), and a new Judson Press release, \"Sympathy, Solidarity, and Silence: Three European Baptist Responses to the Holocaust,\" from October 2022.\n\nThe sources agree on the core facts. The IBTS page is the most direct confirmation of the Amsterdam PhD, and the Judson Press bios and the ABC-USA release confirm the Baptist World Alliance role."], "durationSeconds": 5.104742542000002, "searchCount": 1}, "tool_result_meta": [{"id": "toolu_01FrPfHnLznKFFmdrGULqjw4", "permission_decision": {"decision": "accept", "source": "hook", "reason_type": "hook"}}]}
