{"type": "user", "message": {"role": "user", "content": [{"tool_use_id": "toolu_01UCynXJnqZniznwTeYQRCYn", "type": "tool_result", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "{\"excerpt_removed\": true, \"references\": [{\"url\": \"https://seminary.academia.edu/LeeSpitzer\"}, {\"url\": \"https://jebs.eu/ojs/index.php/jebs/article/view/1266\"}, {\"url\": \"https://baptistnews.com/article/european-school-seeks-to-bolster-baptist-scholarship-and-mission/\"}, {\"url\": \"https://vu.nl/nl/over-de-vu/faculteiten/school-voor-religie-en-theologie/meer-over/international-baptist-theological-study-centre\"}, {\"url\": \"https://vu.nl/nl/over-de-vu/faculteiten/faculteit-religie-en-theologie/meer-over/international-baptist-theological-study-centre\"}, {\"url\": \"https://vu-nl.academia.edu/SamuelLee\"}, {\"url\": \"https://research.vu.nl/en/publications/wij-zouden-jezus-willen-zien-het-evangelie-naar-johannes-herlezen-2/\"}, {\"url\": \"https://www.ibts.eu/about/our-people/dr-hans-riphagen\"}, {\"url\": \"https://cedarville.edu/academics/schools/biblical-and-theological-studies/faculty-staff/lee-jason\"}, {\"url\": \"https://directory.rjcnetwork.org/?p=10016\"}]}"}]}]}, "parent_tool_use_id": null, "timestamp": "2026-10-20T12:29:27.521Z", "tool_use_result": {"query": "\"Lee Spitzer\" \"PhD in\" Vrije Universiteit Amsterdam International Baptist Theological Study Centre Judson Press author", "results": [{"tool_use_id": "srvtoolu_01WjqorAea8hUKE7VBTVQoCJ", "content": [{"title": "seminary.academia.edu", "url": "https://seminary.academia.edu/LeeSpitzer"}, {"title": "Book Reviews", "url": "https://jebs.eu/ojs/index.php/jebs/article/view/1266"}, {"title": "Baptist News Global", "url": "https://baptistnews.com/article/european-school-seeks-to-bolster-baptist-scholarship-and-mission/"}, {"title": "Onderwijs Onderzoek Actueel Over de VU EN", "url": "https://vu.nl/nl/over-de-vu/faculteiten/school-voor-religie-en-theologie/meer-over/international-baptist-theological-study-centre"}, {"title": "Onderwijs Onderzoek Actueel Over de VU EN", "url": "https://vu.nl/nl/over-de-vu/faculteiten/faculteit-religie-en-theologie/meer-over/international-baptist-theological-study-centre"}, {"title": "vu-nl.academia.edu", "url": "https://vu-nl.academia.edu/SamuelLee"}, {"title": "'Wij zouden Jezus willen zien': Het evangelie naar Johannes herlezen met een catechetische blik", "url": "https://research.vu.nl/en/publications/wij-zouden-jezus-willen-zien-het-evangelie-naar-johannes-herlezen-2/"}, {"title": "Our use of cookies", "url": "https://www.ibts.eu/about/our-people/dr-hans-riphagen"}, {"title": "Jason K. Lee", "url": "https://cedarville.edu/academics/schools/biblical-and-theological-studies/faculty-staff/lee-jason"}, {"title": "directory.rjcnetwork.org", "url": "https://directory.rjcnetwork.org/?p=10016"}]}, "The search confirms part of the query but not the PhD detail.\n\n- **Affiliation:** An academia.edu profile lists Lee Spitzer as a historian for the Baptist World Alliance, an affiliate professor of church history at Northern Seminary, and a research fellow at IBTS, Amsterdam. He is also a retired ABCUSA General Secretary.\n- **Book:** A Journal of European Baptist Studies review lists Lee B. Spitzer, Sympathy, Solidarity, and Silence: Three European Baptist Responses to the Holocaust (Valley Forge, PA: Judson Press, 2022).\n- **VU/IBTS link:** The IBTS and the VU's School of Religion and Theology jointly offer PhD programs, so a research fellowship at IBTS is consistent with VU doctoral work. However, none of the results state that Spitzer holds a PhD, what field it is in, or which university awarded it.\n\nThe results do not confirm the \"PhD in\" detail. A check of the VU or IBTS staff pages, or of the book's jacket copy, would be the next step."], "durationSeconds": 6.788118375000002, "searchCount": 1}, "tool_result_meta": [{"id": "toolu_01UCynXJnqZniznwTeYQRCYn", "permission_decision": {"decision": "accept", "source": "hook", "reason_type": "hook"}}]}
